invalid type: string "Commercial Rooftop (10–100 kWp): TOPCon is increasingly preferred due to lower BOS (Balance of System) cost — you need fewer panels, less wiring, fewer mounting structures.\n\nUtility Scale (above 500 kWp): Almost universally shifting to TOPCon. The 1.56% LCOE reduction over 25 years translates to crores in savings at MW-scale.\n\no 30% vs 20% for PERC)\n\nCons of TOPCon: